#666666\">Diskusikan hambatan adopsi AI di pendidikan Indonesia: infrastruktur digital, literasi teknologi guru, dan kesenjangan akses.</span></em></p><p> </p><p style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"color:#AAAAAA\">[Tulis konten Anda di sini...]</span></p><p> </p><p style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm\"><strong><span style=\"color:#222222\">Tags:</span></strong></p><p> </p><p style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#1A73E8\"> EdTech </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#666666\"> | </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#1A73E8\"> AI Pendidikan </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#666666\"> | </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#1A73E8\"> Adaptive Learning </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#666666\"> | </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#1A73E8\"> E-Learning </span></strong></p><p> </p>', 'uploads/1771312816_aerps-com-5Gv-6g_lu-Y-unsplash.jpg', NULL, 'publish', 'public', 1, '2026-02-17 00:19:00', '2026-02-18 13:39:58', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0);
